105	// A bare 32-byte share is not self-describing: nothing in it says which generation of shares it
106	// belongs to or which index it is, so combining a share from one split with a share from a *later*
107	// re-split would silently reconstruct a wrong-but-valid-looking 32 bytes. The v2 envelope makes a
